ESIGN NOTES" (at 427 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a82cb0ff-2bdf-45f5-a55e-ed1650bcb804")) (text "ARCHITECTURE\n\nATtiny1616-only: MCU PWM drives HV boost,\ncounts pulses, serves I2C, reads A0/A1 and\nHV/3V3 ADC. No TLC555 / MCP6562.\nRaw TTL pulse path stays hardware." (at 430 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "74919768-a9a0-4421-9c34-8652fca31f13")) (text "PIN MAP — U1\n\nPA2 COLLECTOR   PA4 SDA   PA5 SCL\nPA6 SENSE (HV)  PA7 V3V3_SENSE\nPB0 A0   PB1 A1   PB2 HV_PWM   PB3 EN\nPA0 UPDI   PA1 UART_TX (USART0 alt)\nDefault USART0 TX is PB2 — remapped." (at 430 72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "370493be-40bb-4589-89b0-eb4dd90412bd")) (text "STEMMA QT / ADDRESS\n\nJ4/J5 JST-SH: 1=GND 2=3V3 3=SDA 4=SCL\nJP2/JP3 open = 0x2F; bridge = low bit.\nOne pull-up set per bus segment." (at 430 132 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ebe473c9-b055-4a68-9015-a6392cb42480")) (text "BOOST / HV\n\nQ3 HL2310A (1=G 2=S 3=D); R25 gate.\nL1 1 mH — watch DCR (~9.5 R).\nC1–C8: 10nF C0G 630V 1206.\nD1–D8: BAV21W. SW ~106 Vpk; S4 ~399 V." (at 430 178 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "564eba24-4287-4d53-933b-863a3f85fcdc")) (text "SAFETY / FAB\n\n400 V on tube clips / HV nodes.\nDischarge before handling.\nPCB: known DRC issues — prototype only.\nClips C142864 DNP; fit after assembly.\nRun ERC; human-review HV creepage." (at 430 238 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "350234c0-f5a4-4d8a-bd91-e0295b8d796d")) (wire (pts (xy 55.88 200.66) (xy 58.42 200.66)) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type default) (color 20 120 120 1)) (uuid "03296c1e-1ee2-40da-a9a0-24837bf1e73d")) (label "ANODE" (at 58.42 200.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "83f0cfe7-9086-46df-99a3-22597de8ac52")) (wire (pts (xy 114.3 218.44) (xy 114.3 215.9)) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type default) (color 20 120 120 1)) (uuid "deaa5314-7